    {
      "id": "A1-15-L2",
      "position": 2,
      "skill": "grammar",
      "title": "قاعدة: How are you? I am + feeling (very)",
      "est_minutes": 15,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "How are you? I am fine. I am very tired. He is hungry. We are happy."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "لنسأل عن حال شخص نقول: **How are you?** (كيف حالك؟) ونجيب: **I am** + الشعور:\n\n- I am **fine**. = أنا بخير.\n- I am **tired**. = أنا متعب.\n- He is **hungry**. = هو جائع.\n\nنستخدم **very** (جداً) قبل الصفة لنقوّيها: I am **very** tired. (أنا متعب جداً).\n\nالفعل **be** يتغير: I **am**, you **are**, he/she **is**, we/they **are**.\n\n**الخطأ الشائع:** أن نقول «I have hungry» أو «I am have hungry». الصحيح: **I am hungry**."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "من؟",
            "be",
            "مثال"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "I",
              "am",
              "I am very tired."
            ],
            [
              "he / she",
              "is",
              "She is happy."
            ],
            [
              "we / you / they",
              "are",
              "We are hungry."
            ],
            [
              "How",
              "are you",
              "How are you? I am fine."
            ]
          ]
        },
